{"slug":"greetings-starter-l9","artistFeel":"The Weeknd","beat":"Chill Slow","data":{"title":"Greetings & Conversation — Starter · Lesson 9","subject":"greetings","subjectLabel":"Greetings & Conversation","level":"starter","lesson":9,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"Pop","lyrics":"[Intro]\n¡Aquí vamos!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola, hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nCome on… Vente ya\nSmile, laugh, and say.\nAt the table, we gather,\nsharing stories every day.\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar.\n\n[Verse]\nFamily's here, it's getting loud,\nOye… Hey, what's up?\nBuenas… Hi to everyone,\nTime to have some fun.\nChaos, laughter, food's on the way,\nPerdona… Excuse me, please.\nPass the salt, I need to say,\nGracias… Thanks a lot.\nNice to meet you,… Encantado\nEvery face is new.\nAt the table, we unite,\nCuéntame… Tell me more.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola, hola\nHow are you?… ¿Cómo estás?\nCome on… Vente ya\nSmile, laugh, and say.\nAt the table, we gather,\nsharing stories every day.\nLet's talk… Vamos a hablar.\n\n[Verse]\nClinking glasses, toasts to make,\nClaro… Of course, I'll join the cheer.\nVale… Okay, another round,\nWe're here to celebrate.\nLaughter echoes, voices blend,\nCuídate… Take care, my friend.\nDe nada… You're welcome, anytime,\nFeel the warmth, it's genuine.\n\n[Bridge]","vocab":[{"es":"buenas","en":"hi"},{"es":"chao","en":"bye"},{"es":"encantado","en":"nice to meet you"},{"es":"oye","en":"hey"},{"es":"cuídate","en":"take care"},{"es":"gracias","en":"thanks"},{"es":"perdona","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"claro","en":"of course"},{"es":"vale","en":"okay"},{"es":"cuéntame","en":"tell me"},{"es":"venga","en":"come on"},{"es":"cierto","en":"right"},{"es":"perfecto","en":"perfect"},{"es":"buen viaje","en":"have a good trip"},{"es":"hasta pronto","en":"see you soon"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.079,"end":0.959,"loss":6.218833160400391},{"start":0.959,"end":5.220000000000001,"loss":4.5585290091378345},{"start":5.220000000000001,"end":6.759,"loss":2.934271503217293},{"start":6.759,"end":7